  "label": "Historical Consequence",
  "description": "A historical consequence is the result or impact of a historical event. The assassination of Abraham Lincoln had significant historical consequences, including the collapse of the Confederate cause and the eventual passage of the 13th Amendment. The meme's use of dark humor to trivialize this event can be seen as disrespectful to the gravity of the event and the suffering it caused.",
